          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Wartime logistics bottlenecks and parts shortages delay maintenance and constrain delivery of critical catalysts and spares, forcing refineries to cut runs and lowering overall crude-to-fuel processing rates." />
