          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Heightened logistics and spare-parts bottlenecks (for tankers, repair yards, and port services) increase vessel downtime and rerouting costs, causing a measurable rise in losses and declines in bilateral and transit trade flows through the Persian Gulf." />
