          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="An accelerated flow of arms and munitions into international markets driven by increased defense production shortens procurement cycles for regional actors and enables higher-tempo operations and show-of-force deployments that raise operational escalation in the Persian Gulf." />
