          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A sustained rise in Western and allied defense procurement to arm Ukraine increases immediate global demand for advanced subsystems (avionics, sensors, microelectronics), intensifying US–China competition over suppliers, export controls and market access as both sides jockey to secure/deny those inputs." />
