          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Tighter sanctions on Russian oil, shipping services, insurance and payments directly reduce accessible export volumes and raise transaction and risk premia, tightening available diesel supply and driving benchmark diesel prices upward." />
