          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Tighter and more widely enforced sanctions (including secondary sanctions) force insurers, banks, and freight operators to reprice exposure to routes and counterparties, producing immediate increases in insurance and financing premia that lift overall risk premia for Persian Gulf commerce." />
