          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Tighter and more consistently enforced sanctions (including secondary measures) against Russian entities directly incentivize China and other partners to accelerate domestic industrial policy and procurement strategies to reduce exposure to Western-controlled finance and technologies, boosting strategic-autonomy initiatives." />
