          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Higher-frequency, high-level US–China diplomacy reduces uncertainty about crisis management and deconfliction, lowering market and insurer perceptions of systemic risk for Gulf routes and thus compressing risk premia; the reverse (less engagement) raises premia." />
