          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Increased high‑level diplomatic engagement between Washington and Beijing produces bargaining over Russia policy and can result in China resisting or narrowing cooperation on secondary sanctions and information‑sharing, reducing overall sanctions enforcement pressure on Russian actors." />
